  "body": "Step into your dream home - A Stunning New Home, where luxury and lifestyle collide. With an impressive 168 sqm of beautifully crafted space, this north-facing gem is flooded with sunlight, creating the perfect backdrop for your next chapter. Whether you're unwinding after a long day or throwing an unforgettable party, this home has it all!\r\n\r\nWhy this home will steal your heart:\r\n\r\nA  floor area that's as expansive as it is inviting - a true sanctuary of space!\r\nTimeless brick and sleek long-run iron roof - not just durable, but undeniably stylish\r\nSpacious Open-plan living designed for life's big moments - space for that extra-large couch you've been eyeing, with a cozy study nook for when you need to get things done!\r\nFour dreamy double bedrooms, all tucked away for privacy and comfort - each with generous built-in wardrobes\r\nA designer kitchen that will make you swoon: high-end appliances, a spacious walk-in pantry, and plumbing ready for your double fridge - chef's kiss!\r\nIndulge in the luxurious master suite, complete with an ensuite, walk-in wardrobe, and a calming retreat feel\r\nA  backyard that's child and pet-friendly, ideal for weekend BBQs, playdates, or just basking in the sun\r\nBreathtaking views to enjoy from the comfort of your new home\r\n\r\nThis home is not just new - it's next-level, with all the bells and whistles you could want! Move in, spread out, and start living your best life. Call me now at 021988669 to make it yours - this is one you won't want to miss!",
